 .../vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_simd.comp      | 107 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp     |  24 ++++
 3 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_simd.comp

